WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.760
Tiffany Smith: Please welcome to the stage, first, the executive producer, Todd Helbing. C'mon out here, sir.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.520
Next up, we've got Keiynan Lonsdale, you guys know him as Wally West.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.580
Mr Jesse L. Martin, Joe West!

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.340
Next up, you've got Iris West, Candice Patton! Come on out here!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.560
Tiffany: And next up, we've got Barry Allen himself, Grant Gustin!

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:40.960
And next, Harrison Wells. We've got Mr. Tom Cavanagh.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.140
And next, you've got Danielle Panabaker

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.960
I don't even know what we're gonna call her yet this season!

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.820
Killer Frost? Caitlin Snow?

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:53.480
We'll have to see :)

00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:00.240
And finally, we've got Cisco, aka Vibe, aka Carlos Valdes!

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.640
We've a got a very good saunter onto this stage

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.640
It's still goin', the saunter is still goin'...

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:13.940
I like it a lot...

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:14.900
*chuckles*

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:19.280
Well, welcome everybody. We're so excited to have you here and talk a lil' bit about last season

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.280
And, obviously, get into the new season as well..

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:26.080
I kinda want to jump in from the beginning and talk about last season feeling very different

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.080
from the other 2 seasons that we had

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.780
It got a little bit darker, but for all of you guys on the panel; kinda just jump in...

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:36.380
How much fun was that for you? Or what did you love about kinda going a little bit darker, getting a little more emotional..

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:38.080
Grant: Er...

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:38.880
Tom: Go...

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.560
Danielle: So much more fun to be bad...

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:48.660
Danielle: It was fun, I got to be Killer Frost and take it, y'know, a little bit darker, a little bit edgier, that was great!

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:52.860
Tiffany: Well, and kinda jumping off of that and joking about some of the stuff that we saw..

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:59.080
We've seen you go full Killer Frost, we've seen full Caitlin Snow, and I've kinda come up...have come up with a new name

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:04.300
Do you think this new season she's gonna be like "Light Flurries" or something (lol)

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:05.520
Caitlin: That's awesome

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.580
Tiffany: Thanks guys, for that laugh.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.520
Great job :D

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.580
Where is she gonna be in the next season kind of?

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:15.820
I mean, i don't know.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.580
Who are there likes Caitlin Snow?

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.500
(Audience Cheers)

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.680
And.. Who likes Killer Frost?

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.440
(Audience Cheers)

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.740
Guys, good news. No one is gonna be disappointed.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.160
(Cheers)

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.820
That was a good answer.. politically correct, she didn't give too much away.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:37.600
Thanks.. I've been practicing all day. I loved it.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:44.940
So we obviously got full dark from Caitlin Snow Killer Frost last season, also Savitar obviously being the big bad of the season

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:51.160
For all of you guys, when did you know that it was actually going to be a different version of Barry

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.180
and how did that kind of impact your acting on the show?

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.400
I knew pretty early on

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:56.400
Umm

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.880
It didn't obviously affect too much for me, cause Barry, didn't know... Um

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.760
But yeah... I knew pretty early on. Didn't everyone know pretty early on?

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.140
I think so. Yeah.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.580
We're not good at keeping secrets.

